	"title"		"soccer_1v1_cage"
	"description"		"[h1]soccer_1v1_cage[/h1]
One against one for CS2 SoccerMod, in a cage on the bottom of a drained swimming pool: an old bathhouse at night, taken over by street footballers.

[h2]What it is[/h2]
[list]
[*] The pitch is the pool's bottom, 600 x 880 units; the tiled walls are in play and a steel cage stands on the pool's edge - the ball never leaves
[*] Round lamps glow in the pool's walls; four work lights on tripods stand on the deck
[*] Lane lines on the floor, depth markings and old signs on the walls, ladders, graffiti on the tiles
[*] Small goals set into the pool's end walls
[*] Onlookers at the cage, along the gallery and on the diving tower
[*] The old hall round it: an arcade with changing cabins, a gallery, a glass vault with the night sky, a mosaic, starting blocks
[*] Working radar
[/list]

[h2]Made for SoccerMod[/h2]
Kicking, goals and matches come from the CS2 SoccerMod server plugin: [url=https://github.com/Deidakom/CS2_Soccer_Mod]github.com/Deidakom/CS2_Soccer_Mod[/url]. This item carries everything the plugin shows and plays (models, sounds, menus), so a server needs no second item. Without the plugin the map loads, but the ball is only a physics prop.

[h2]Patch notes[/h2]
[b]2026-10-02[/b] First version.
"
	"changenote"		"First version."
